{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">: Punctuation</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310412","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/Punctuation_5.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/Punctuation_5.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"Punctuation_5\" role=\"article\"> \n <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">: Punctuation</h1> \n  \n <div class=\"body refbody\"> \n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"Punctuation_5__section_N10033_N10030_N10001\"> \n   <p class=\"p\">The colon (:) symbol ends block labels and block header statements like DO, FOR, and REPEAT. It also serves as a separator between:</p> \n   <ul class=\"ul\"> \n    <li class=\"li\">A handle reference and an attribute or method, for example <code class=\"ph codeph\">\n      ttCust:PRIVATE-DATA\n     </code> or <code class=\"ph codeph\">\n      ttCust:CLEAR( )\n     </code>, where <code class=\"ph codeph\">\n      ttCust\n     </code> is a handle to a temp-table</li> \n    <li class=\"li\">An object or static type-name reference and a class-based property, method, or event, for example, <code class=\"ph codeph\">\n      rObj:ToString( )\n     </code>, <code class=\"ph codeph\">\n      rObj:NEXT-SIBLING\n     </code>, or <code class=\"ph codeph\">\n      Progress.Lang.Class:GetClass( &quot;Progress.Data.BindingSource&quot; )\n     </code>, where <code class=\"ph codeph\">\n      rObj\n     </code> is an object reference to a <code class=\"ph codeph\">\n      Progress.Lang.Object\n     </code> instance</li> \n    <li class=\"li\">A character string literal and one of its options, for example, <code class=\"ph codeph\">\n      &quot;City/State/Zip&quot;:U\n     </code></li> \n   </ul> \n   <p class=\"p\">It also follows the EDITING keyword in an EDITING phrase and is a device delimiter in Windows.</p> \n   <p class=\"p\">See <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Punctuation.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Punctuation.html\">:: Punctuation</a> for rules to help you decide whether to use period, colon, or double colon syntax.</p> \n  </section> \n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"Punctuation_5__see-also_GC15M2678535\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d218966e153\">See also</h2> \n    \n   <p class=\"p\"> <a class=\"xref\" href=\"#rfi1424920639277\">#rfi1424920639277</a>, <a class=\"xref\" href=\"#rfi1424920639277\">#rfi1424920639277</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Character-string-literal.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Character-string-literal.html\">&quot; &quot;Character-string literal</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Class-based-object-reference.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Class-based-object-reference.html\">Class-based object reference</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Type-name-syntax.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Type-name-syntax.html\">Type-name syntax</a></p> \n  </section> \n </div> \n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Punctuation.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Punctuation.html\">:: Punctuation</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310412","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1412,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":": Punctuation","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Punctuation_5.html","type":"Manual"}